<Base title="myColorado \u2014 Mobile driver\u2019s license \u2014 Chris Mackintosh" description="An initial look at Chris Mackintosh’s design work helping bring the myColorado mobile driver’s license to launch for TSA identity verification.">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><Masthead breadcrumbs={[{label:'Selected work',href:'/#mycolorado-work'},{label:'myColorado',href:'/mycolorado/'},{label:'Mobile driver’s license'}]} /><main id="main" class="page initiative-detail" tabindex="-1">
<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">myColorado / Digital identity</p><h1>Mobile driver’s license</h1><p class="deck">Helping a long-running initiative move forward, from stalled work to launch.</p></header>
<section class="launch-panel" aria-labelledby="launch-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Shipped / myColorado mDL</p><h2 id="launch-title">A new way through airport security.</h2></div><div><p>Our team launched a mobile driver’s license you can use at TSA.</p><a class="cm-inline-link" href="https://www.tsa.gov/news/press/releases/2026/08/31/tsa-accepts-mycolorado-mdls-during-identity-verification" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="cm-intro-link-text">Read the TSA announcement</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></section>
<section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="context-title"><h2 id="context-title">The context</h2><div class="chapter-copy"><p class="lead">This initiative sits within my broader work leading design across myColorado.</p><p>The mobile driver’s license had been a long-running effort. I helped our team unblock the work and bring it to launch, while continuing to work across the wider product and its design system.</p><dl class="facts"><div><dt>My role</dt><dd>Design lead</dd></div><div><dt>Product</dt><dd>myColorado</dd></div><div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Digital identity</dd></div></dl></div></section>
<section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="launch-story-title"><h2 id="launch-story-title">The launch</h2><div class="chapter-copy"><p>Our team’s work brought the mobile driver’s license to TSA identity verification. I was invited to DIA with the team for the governor’s announcement.</p><p><a class="cm-inline-link" href="https://x.com/GovofCO/status/2094562971292762554" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="cm-intro-link-text">See the announcement</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p></div></section>
<section class="in-progress" aria-labelledby="story-title"><p class="eyebrow">Case study in progress</p><h2 id="story-title">The work behind the launch</h2><p>The detailed story and supporting design artifacts are coming next.</p><ul class="story-outline"><li>Where the work was blocked</li><li>Decisions and tradeoffs</li><li>From design to launch</li></ul></section>
<a class="return-link cm-inline-link" href="../#initiatives"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span><span class="cm-intro-link-text">All myColorado initiatives</span></a>
</main><ProductFooter />
</Base>

